# CONTACT RHYTHM CULTURE

### Contact Rhythm Culture

# Get in Touch – African Drumming & Dance Workshops

We'd love to hear from you!

Whether you're looking for an exciting African drumming incursion for your school, an African dance workshop, a team-building experience for your workplace, or information about our regular drumming and dance classes, we'd love to help you bring the energy of rhythm and movement to your group.

At Rhythm Culture, we share the joy of African drumming and dancing through engaging, interactive and inclusive experiences. We work with schools, early learning centres, community groups, councils, businesses and organisations across the Sunshine Coast and beyond, creating opportunities for people of all ages and abilities to connect through music, movement and shared experience.

Our African drumming workshops and school incursions offer students the opportunity to explore rhythm, develop musical skills, work together and experience the excitement of making music as a group. Our African dance workshops bring people together through movement, cultural expression and the infectious energy of traditional African dance.

We also offer corporate drumming workshops, team-building activities, community events and regular drumming and dance classes for those wanting to develop their skills, meet new people and experience the fun of making music together.

**Have a question or ready to book?** Simply choose the appropriate contact option below and tell us a little about what you're looking for. Whether you're organising a school incursion, planning an event, enquiring about classes or exploring a workshop for your organisation, we're happy to chat and help you find the right experience.

We love building community, sharing drumming and dancing and, most of all, having too much fun!

We look forward to hearing from you.

**The Rhythm Culture Team**

